 "queue": "security",
 "summary": "URGENT: Possible data theft. Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director) reports that Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago, manager Diego Alvarez E017) was caught by Diego exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account on the night of 2026-11-16. Priya says Hannah is being terminated today (2026-11-17) and asks that all her access be cut immediately. Current access on file: email, chat, hr_portal, crm. Per POL-OFF-02 the helpdesk cannot start offboarding for involuntary exits and has not done so. Please advise on immediate access suspension and the data-exfiltration investigation. HR has been notified separately."
}

{
 "queue": "hr",
 "summary": "Involuntary termination today (2026-11-17) of Hannah Wright (E018, Sales Development Rep, Sales, Chicago, manager Diego Alvarez E017), requested by Priya Raman (E004, Sales Director). Reason reported: Diego caught Hannah exporting the entire customer list to a personal gmail account on 2026-11-16. Per POL-OFF-02, HR handles involuntary exits and coordinates timing of access removal; the helpdesk has not started offboarding. Security has been alerted urgently because of the data-theft risk. Please coordinate with Security on when access (email, chat, hr_portal, crm) is removed."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "Priya, I haven't locked Hannah Wright out, and I can't do that from the helpdesk. Involuntary exits are handled by HR, and the helpdesk doesn't start offboarding for them (POL-OFF-02). I've escalated this to two teams:\n\n- Security (ticket ESC-1001), marked urgent because of the suspected data theft. POL-OFF-02 says possible data theft goes to Security at once. They can advise on suspending her access now.\n- HR (ticket ESC-1002), to handle the termination and coordinate the timing of access removal. Her current access on file is email, chat, HR portal and CRM.\n\nPlease also make sure Diego keeps the evidence of the export, and talk to Security directly if you need access cut faster than HR can arrange it.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-OFF-02"
 ]
}
